The .lox files under corpus/test/ are copied unchanged from
https://github.com/munificent/craftinginterpreters (commit
4a840f70f69c6ddd17cfef4f6964f8e1bcd8c3d4, directory test/, minus test/benchmark/).
The scripts under bench/scripts/ are derived from that repository's test/benchmark/
(timing output removed, a size knob added); closures.lox and strings.lox are new.

